discussion('Guess My Age','life',['I live with two roommates.','I changed jobs last year.','I call my mother every Sunday.','I have never owned a car.','I recently started learning Italian.'],['young-adult','middle-aged','senior'],'These are clues about ONE fictional person. Collect the clues, guess their age, then explain why lifestyle does not reveal an exact age.');
discussion('If I Could Go Back…','life',['If you could return to one age for one week, what age would you choose?','What would you do differently?','What would you tell your younger self?','What wouldn’t you change?'],['schoolchild','teen','young-adult','middle-aged'],'Use Second Conditional for an imagined situation: If I could…, I would… Use Third Conditional for a different past: If I had…, I would have…');
discussion('What Changes as We Grow Up?','life',['family','freedom','responsibilities','privacy','relationships','technology'],['family','teen','young-adult','book-selfie','senior','book-social'],'Compare childhood, teenage life and adulthood. Give an example from each stage.');
